{"title":"Monster","artist":"Skillet","date":"2026-07-20","sourceId":"UBCB2e0Aik4:034","sourceHash":"183904679bfdb90920e47c86aeeb0e652c8fceb27fd598f80b27d1102121013e","duration":182.96,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":18.4,"end":20.72,"text":"The secret side of me","translation":"내 안의 은밀한 모습","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":20.72,"end":22.34,"text":"I never let you see","translation":"절대 네게 보이지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":22.34,"end":26.04,"text":"I keep it caged, but I can't control it","translation":"가둬 두지만 뜻대로 되지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":26.04,"end":27.98,"text":"So stay away from me","translation":"그러니 내게서 멀리 떨어져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":27.98,"end":29.34,"text":"The beast is ugly","translation":"그 짐승은 흉측해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":29.34,"end":33.12,"text":"I feel the rage and I just can't hold it","translation":"분노가 차올라 도저히 누를 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":33.12,"end":35.06,"text":"It's scratchin on the walls","translation":"벽을 긁어 대고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":35.06,"end":36.68,"text":"In the closet, in the halls","translation":"벽장에도 복도에도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":36.68,"end":40.16,"text":"It comes awake and I can't control it","translation":"깨어나 버리면 뜻대로 되지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":40.16,"end":42.16,"text":"Hidin under the bed","translation":"침대 아래 숨어서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":42.16,"end":43.82,"text":"In my body, in my head","translation":"내 몸속에 내 머릿속에","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":43.82,"end":47.3,"text":"Why won't somebody come and save me from this?","translation":"왜 아무도 와서 날 구해 주지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":47.3,"end":48.78,"text":"Make it end","translation":"이걸 끝내 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":48.78,"end":51.02,"text":"I feel it deep within","translation":"내 깊은 곳에서 느껴져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":51.08,"end":52.54,"text":"It's just beneath the skin","translation":"피부 바로 아래에 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":52.54,"end":55.94,"text":"I must confess that I feel like a monster","translation":"고백할게 내가 괴물이 된 것만 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":55.94,"end":58.08,"text":"I hate what I've become","translation":"이렇게 변한 내가 싫어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":58.18,"end":59.68,"text":"The nightmare's just begun","translation":"악몽은 이제 막 시작됐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":59.68,"end":62.96,"text":"I must confess that I feel like a monster","translation":"고백할게 내가 괴물이 된 것만 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":62.96,"end":66.68,"text":"I, I feel like a monster","translation":"난 난 괴물이 된 것만 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":66.68,"end":70.64,"text":"I, I feel like a monster","translation":"난 난 괴물이 된 것만 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":77.32,"end":79.54,"text":"My secret side I keep","translation":"내 은밀한 모습은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":79.54,"end":80.96,"text":"Hid under lock and key","translation":"자물쇠와 열쇠 아래 숨겨 둬","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":80.96,"end":84.6,"text":"I keep it caged, but I can't control it","translation":"가둬 두지만 뜻대로 되지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":84.6,"end":86.48,"text":"'Cause if I let him out","translation":"그를 밖으로 풀어 주면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":86.48,"end":88.28,"text":"He'll tear me up, break me down","translation":"날 찢고 날 무너뜨릴 테니","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":88.28,"end":91.82,"text":"Why won't somebody come and save me from this?","translation":"왜 아무도 와서 날 구해 주지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":91.82,"end":92.96,"text":"Make it end","translation":"이걸 끝내 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":92.96,"end":95.5,"text":"I feel it deep within","translation":"내 깊은 곳에서 느껴져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":95.5,"end":97.08,"text":"It's just beneath the skin","translation":"피부 바로 아래에 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":97.08,"end":100.42,"text":"I must confess that I feel like a monster","translation":"고백할게 내가 괴물이 된 것만 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":100.42,"end":102.52,"text":"I hate what I've become","